  "goodToKnow": "Das Glücksspiel is gambling or a game of chance: Roulette, Lotto, Sportwetten (sports betting), Spielautomaten. In Germany it's regulated by the Glücksspielstaatsvertrag (a treaty between the Länder, revised in 2021 to legalise some online gambling). Lotto 6 aus 49, drawn twice a week, is a classic. Die Spielsucht is gambling addiction. Das Glück means both luck and happiness. Plural: die Glücksspiele."
